== Trivia ==
* The title "So Below" comes from the phrase "As above, so below", an alchemical reference, like Raine's other two Nether tracks. Raine's use of the phrase for the title of the track contrasts the "umbral, occult nature of the Nether" to the [[Overworld]] "above".<ref>{{tweet|kuraine|1275489665345150977|I'm going to start up a thread here where every day I'll be running through a little behind-the-scenes insights on one track I wrote for the Nether Update~ I'll kick it off with Chrysopoeia a lil later today, so stay tuned ✨|June 23, 2020|archive=1}}</ref>

